000100*================================================================
000200* PAYROLL - MONTHLY STAFF PAYROLL, SAVINGS BANK (HARDENED)
000300*
000400* Hardened counterpart of examples/vulnerable/PAYROLL.cob:
000500* - the pay-period divisor is validated and every DIVIDE,
000600*   MULTIPLY, ADD, SUBTRACT and COMPUTE has ON SIZE ERROR;
000700* - money is fixed-point decimal (COMP-3), never COMP-2, and
000800*   results are ROUNDED to the cent;
000900* - receiving fields are as wide as their senders;
001000* - file statuses are checked after every OPEN, READ and WRITE;
001100* - the IBAN is displayed masked, and printing is left to the
001200*   job scheduler instead of a shell command.
001300*================================================================
001400 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001500 PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
001600 AUTHOR. ALCAZAR DEMO.
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001900 FILE-CONTROL.
002000     SELECT EMP-MASTER ASSIGN TO "EMPMAST.DAT"
002100         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002200         FILE STATUS IS WS-EMP-FS.
002300     SELECT PAY-CHECKS ASSIGN TO "PAYCHK.DAT"
002400         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
002500         FILE STATUS IS WS-CHK-FS.
002600 DATA DIVISION.
002700 FILE SECTION.
002800 FD  EMP-MASTER.
002900     COPY EMPREC.
003000 FD  PAY-CHECKS.
003100 01  CHECK-LINE.
003200     05  CHK-EMP-ID              PIC X(8).
003300     05  FILLER                  PIC X.
003400     05  CHK-NAME                PIC X(30).
003500     05  FILLER                  PIC X.
003600     05  CHK-AMOUNT              PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
003700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003800 01  WS-EMP-FS                   PIC XX.
003900     88  EMP-OK                  VALUE "00".
004000     88  EMP-EOF                 VALUE "10".
004100 01  WS-CHK-FS                   PIC XX.
004200     88  CHK-OK                  VALUE "00".
004300 01  WS-PAY-PERIODS              PIC 99 VALUE 12.
004400 01  WS-PERIOD-PAY               PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004500 01  WS-GROSS-PAY                PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004600 01  WS-TAX-RATE                 PIC V9999 VALUE .2150.
004700 01  WS-TAX-AMT                  PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004800 01  WS-NET-PAY                  PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004900 01  WS-TOTAL-GROSS              PIC 9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
005000 01  WS-YTD-TAX                  PIC 9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
005100 01  WS-IBAN-MASKED              PIC X(34).
005200 01  WS-RETURN-CODE              PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
005300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005400 0000-MAIN.
005500     IF WS-PAY-PERIODS < 1 OR WS-PAY-PERIODS > 52
005600         DISPLAY "PAYROLL: invalid number of pay periods"
005700         MOVE 8 TO RETURN-CODE
005800         STOP RUN
005900     END-IF
006000     OPEN INPUT EMP-MASTER
006100     IF NOT EMP-OK
006200         DISPLAY "PAYROLL: EMPMAST open status " WS-EMP-FS
006300         MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
006400         STOP RUN
006500     END-IF
006600     OPEN OUTPUT PAY-CHECKS
006700     IF NOT CHK-OK
006800         DISPLAY "PAYROLL: PAYCHK open status " WS-CHK-FS
006900         MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
007000         STOP RUN
007100     END-IF
007200     PERFORM 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE
007300     PERFORM 2000-PAY-EMPLOYEE UNTIL EMP-EOF
007400     CLOSE EMP-MASTER PAY-CHECKS
007500     DISPLAY "TOTAL GROSS PAID " WS-TOTAL-GROSS
007600     MOVE WS-RETURN-CODE TO RETURN-CODE
007700     STOP RUN.
007800
007900 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE.
008000     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO EMP-RECORD
008100     READ EMP-MASTER
008200         AT END SET EMP-EOF TO TRUE
008300     END-READ
008400     IF NOT EMP-OK AND NOT EMP-EOF
008500         DISPLAY "PAYROLL: EMPMAST read status " WS-EMP-FS
008600         MOVE 16 TO WS-RETURN-CODE
008700         SET EMP-EOF TO TRUE
008800     END-IF.
008900
009000 2000-PAY-EMPLOYEE.
009100     DIVIDE EMP-ANNUAL-SALARY BY WS-PAY-PERIODS
009200         GIVING WS-PERIOD-PAY ROUNDED
009300         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
009400     END-DIVIDE
009500     ADD EMP-BONUS TO WS-PERIOD-PAY GIVING WS-GROSS-PAY
009600         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
009700     END-ADD
009800     COMPUTE WS-TAX-AMT ROUNDED = WS-GROSS-PAY * WS-TAX-RATE
009900         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
010000     END-COMPUTE
010100     SUBTRACT WS-TAX-AMT FROM WS-GROSS-PAY GIVING WS-NET-PAY
010200         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
010300     END-SUBTRACT
010400     ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-GROSS
010500         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
010600     END-ADD
010700     ADD WS-TAX-AMT TO WS-YTD-TAX
010800         ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE
010900     END-ADD
011000     MOVE ALL "*" TO WS-IBAN-MASKED
011100     MOVE EMP-IBAN(1:4) TO WS-IBAN-MASKED(1:4)
011200     MOVE EMP-IBAN(31:4) TO WS-IBAN-MASKED(31:4)
011300     DISPLAY "PAYING " EMP-ID " TO ACCOUNT " WS-IBAN-MASKED
011400     MOVE EMP-ID TO CHK-EMP-ID
011500     MOVE EMP-FULL-NAME TO CHK-NAME
011600     MOVE WS-NET-PAY TO CHK-AMOUNT
011700     WRITE CHECK-LINE
011800     IF NOT CHK-OK
011900         DISPLAY "PAYROLL: PAYCHK write status " WS-CHK-FS
012000         MOVE 16 TO WS-RETURN-CODE
012100     END-IF
012200     PERFORM 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE.
012300
012400 8000-REJECT-EMPLOYEE.
012500     DISPLAY "PAYROLL: amount out of range for " EMP-ID
012600     MOVE 4 TO WS-RETURN-CODE.
